IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cma-offences`

-- Computer Misuse Act 1993, ss 2 to 19 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_computer-misuse-act-1993_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

