`selling my Singpass to a stranger online` MEANS `My Singpass disclosure` WITH
    `I have a Singpass account` IS TRUE
    `I disclosed my Singpass password or code, or gave another means of access in my identity` IS TRUE
    `the court finds I knew or had reasonable grounds to believe it was for an offence` IS FALSE
    `I did it for any gain` IS TRUE
    `I knew it was likely to cause someone wrongful loss` IS FALSE
    `I failed to take reasonable steps to find out who and where the recipient was` IS TRUE
    `the court is satisfied I proved the contrary of the presumption` IS FALSE
    `I had reasonable grounds to believe it was for a lawful transaction in my identity` IS FALSE

`selling it, but proving I had no reasonable grounds` MEANS `My Singpass disclosure` WITH
