    `I did it for any gain` IS TRUE
    `I knew it was likely to cause someone wrongful loss` IS FALSE
    `I failed to take reasonable steps to find out who and where the recipient was` IS TRUE
    `the court is satisfied I proved the contrary of the presumption` IS TRUE
    `I had reasonable grounds to believe it was for a lawful transaction in my identity` IS FALSE

